  "file": "binary_search.py",
  "text": "def binary_search(a, target):\n    lo, hi = 0, len(a) - 1\n    while lo <= hi:\n        mid = (lo + hi) // 2\n        if a[mid] == target:\n            return mid\n        if a[mid] < target:\n            lo = mid + 1\n        else:\n            hi = mid - 1\n    return -1\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    print(binary_search([1, 3, 4, 7, 9, 11, 15], 9))\n",
